/ Stage 11 (decision 129, Ingi yes): one door to an actor. %!app.system% and %!app.user% go; the actor is reached
/ through the actor type, one picked by name in brackets.
Start
- assert %!app.actor["system"]% is not null
- assert %!app.actor["user"]% is not null
- assert %!app.system% is null, "the app doesn't hold its actors twice"
